@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix aap:  <https://ggen.dev/ash-a2a-app#> .

# L19 (G2): EA admission graph projection. templates/L19_ea_graph.json.tmpl emits ea.graph.json
# (schema ggen.ea.graph.v1) so a generated project passes the fail-closed EA gate (FM-LAW-015)
# without --skip-ea-admission.

aap:eaDeclare a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
  rdfs:domain aap:Project ;
  rdfs:comment """"true"|"false" (default "false"). false: emit the minimal valid graph `ggen init`
writes (strategy + empty capabilities/abbs/contracts/candidate_sbbs/qualifications/packs).
true: additionally declare one capability, ABB and contract per aap:Agent. Candidate SBBs and
qualifications are never emitted: their sha256 digests are computed by ggen-abb-sbb, not
derivable from Turtle (see fragments/L19-NOTES.md).""" .
